        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 222202, Barn Door Privacy Lock Set with Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Modern Rectangular Barn Door Privacy Lock Set comes packaged with everything you'll need for your barn door. It includes the flush pull with integrated strike to receive the latch from the privacy lock. This Barn Door Privacy Lock Set with Flush Pull is mounted to the interior side of the door and door jam. It has an emergency egress hole with pin on the outside of the door. The Emtek 222202 Modern Barn Door Privacy Lock with Flush Pull is available in a wide array of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Barn Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency release pin. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-222202-Install.jpg?v=1704354742\" width=\"370\" height=\"246\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 222202 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Rectangular Barn Door Privacy Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Height: 7-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Thumbturn Length: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull with Strike Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull with Strike Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull with Strike Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cut-Out: 2-1/8\" x 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Cut-Out: 5/16\" x 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/specials/pdf/emtek/EMT-222202-Specification.pdf\"><b>Emtek 222202 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-222202-Install.pdf?v=1704262403\"><b>Emtek 222202 Installation Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> (1) trim escutcheon with thumbturn, (1) flush pull with integrated strike, (1) emergency release key, and the mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-barndoor-finishes.jpg?v=1704354676\" width=\"514\" height=\"226\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
