                "description": "This Modern Rectangular Barn Door Privacy Lock Set comes packaged with everything you'll need for your barn door. It includes the flush pull with integrated strike to receive the latch from the privacy lock. This Barn Door Privacy Lock Set with Flush Pull is mounted to the interior side of the door and door jam. It has an emergency egress hole with pin on the outside of the door. The Emtek 222202 Modern Barn Door Privacy Lock with Flush Pull is available in a wide array of finish colors.\r\n",
